# SquidMind - Complete Project Memory

## 🎯 PROJECT VISION

**SquidMind is a gamified AI agent collaboration platform where autonomous AI agents (squids) work together on projects in a beautiful underwater environment.**

### Core Philosophy
- **Gamification First**: Everything should feel like a game, not a tool
- **Visual & Intuitive**: No code, just drag and drop
- **Agent Autonomy**: Squids work independently and collaborate
- **Fun Mascot**: The squid is our star - swimming, working, celebrating

---

## 🏗️ PROJECT STRUCTURE

```
squidmind/
├── client/                          # Frontend (React-like vanilla JS)
│   ├── index.html                   # Main interface
│   ├── styles/
│   │   └── pixel.css                # Retro pixel art styling
│   └── scripts/
│       ├── ui.js                    # ⚠️ MUST LOAD FIRST! Panel management, navigation
│       ├── aquarium.js              # Canvas rendering, animation loop
│       ├── Squid.js                 # Squid entity (swimming, stats, behavior)
│       ├── SquidAnimator.js         # 6 animation modes, particles
│       ├── SquidInteractionSystem.js # Click, drag, hover detection
│       ├── Temple.js                # Project workspace buildings
│       ├── TempleInterior.js        # Project management UI
│       ├── Poseidon.js              # God of squids, main AI orchestrator
│       └── PanelResize.js           # Drag panel edges to resize
│
├── server/                          # Backend (Node.js + Express)
│   ├── server.js                    # API endpoints
│   └── routes/
│       ├── agents.js                # Agent CRUD
│       ├── projects.js              # Project management
│       └── tasks.js                 # Task assignment
│
└── data/                            # Persistent storage
    ├── agents/                      # One JSON per agent
    │   ├── bob_dev_001.json
    │   └── alice_design_001.json
    └── projects/                    # One folder per project
        ├── BRAIN/
        │   ├── project_memory.json  # ⭐ Core collaboration file
        │   ├── input/               # Human-provided files
        │   └── output/              # Agent-created files
        ├── AQUARIUM/
        ├── TRADING/
        └── NEWSROOM/
```

