## 🦑 THE SQUID (Mascot & Agent)

### Squid Entity
```javascript
{
  id: "bob_dev_001",
  name: "Bob",
  specialty: "Full-Stack Developer",
  
  // Visual
  x: 300,
  y: 400,
  color: 180,        // Hue rotation
  outfit: "hoodie",
  size: 1.0,
  
  // Animation
  animationMode: "swimming", // swimming, walking, working, celebrating, sleeping, thinking
  direction: 0,              // degrees (0=right, 90=down, 180=left, 270=up)
  
  // Personality Stats
  energy: 75,       // 0-100, decreases over time
  happiness: 80,    // 0-100, affected by tasks
  focus: 50,        // 0-100, increases when working
  
  // Work
  currentProject: "BRAIN",
  currentTask: "task_123",
  status: "working", // idle, working, thinking, sleeping
  
  // Brain (AI)
  brain: {
    model: "claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
    temperature: 0.7,
    system_prompt: "You are Bob, a senior developer...",
    available_tools: ["code_interpreter", "file_operations", "git_operations"]
  }
}
```

### 6 Animation Modes

1. **🌊 Swimming** (default)
   - Fluid tentacle waves
   - Water particle trail
   - Smooth direction changes
   - Used when: idle, moving around

2. **🚶 Walking** (on ground)
   - Bouncy step animation
   - Footstep particles
   - Ground contact
   - Used when: outside water areas

3. **💻 Working** (focused)
   - Minimal movement
   - Code particles (< > { } ;)
   - Focus stat increases
   - Used when: assigned to task

4. **🎉 Celebrating** (excited)
   - Big jumps
   - Confetti particles
   - Happiness boost
   - Used when: task complete

5. **😴 Sleeping** (resting)
   - Slow breathing
   - Z particles
   - Energy restoration
   - Used when: energy < 20

6. **🤔 Thinking** (pondering)
   - Head tilt
   - Thought bubbles
   - Contemplative
   - Used when: planning, deciding

