## 🏛️ TEMPLES (Project Workspaces)

### 4 Default Temples

1. **BRAIN** (AI/ML projects)
   - Purple gradient background
   - Research & development

2. **AQUARIUM** (Platform itself)
   - Blue gradient background
   - Meta-development

3. **TRADING** (Finance/crypto)
   - Pink gradient background
   - Trading bots, analysis

4. **NEWSROOM** (Content/media)
   - Cyan gradient background
   - Article writing, research

### Temple Interior Structure

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 🏛️ BRAIN TEMPLE                                │
├─────────────┬─────────────────┬─────────────────┤
│ LEFT        │ CENTER          │ RIGHT           │
├─────────────┼─────────────────┼─────────────────┤
│ 📥 INPUT    │ 🦑 WORKING      │ 📋 KANBAN       │
│ Resources   │ AGENTS          │ ├─ TODO         │
│ (human)     │ (real squids)   │ ├─ IN PROGRESS  │
│             │                 │ └─ DONE         │
├─────────────┤                 ├─────────────────┤
│ 📤 OUTPUT   │ 💻 IDE          │ 🔄 CRON         │
│ Resources   │ Editor+Preview  │ Scheduled Tasks │
│ (agents)    │                 │                 │
├─────────────┤                 │                 │
